+
+# Excalidraw Data
+
+## Embedded Files
+file_id_123: [[attachments/pasted_image.png]]
+
+%%
+## Drawing
+```json
+{json_str}
+```
+%%"""
+        excalidraw_file.write_text(markdown_content, encoding="utf-8")
